<p>A crash fix for AAB to APK, and a stricter keystore picker.</p>
<h3>Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>No more crash when converting an AAB</strong> — asking for notification
permission (so the converter can tell you when a background install
finishes) crashed the app on the newest macOS, whether you allowed or
denied. The permission request now uses a thread-safe path.</li>
<li>
<strong>The keystore chooser only accepts keystores</strong> — the signing file picker
greys out everything except <code>.keystore</code> and <code>.jks</code> files, in both the AAB
converter's signing sheet and APK Studio's Sign tab.</li>
</ul>
